    "body": "Sorry, yes, we should have added some tests (ok to revert, and I can send again). @annevk, I'm also happy to keep maintaining the Gecko implementation, as I know the code well. \r\n\r\nHowever, do you or other folks are Mozilla want to discuss if `media=` should apply at all to link type \"manifest\"? You mentioned elsewhere that maybe it shouldn't. ",
