    "body": "I'll create a PR to revert. During the conversation with @beaufortfrancois in https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/500 I have convinced myself that it should not apply to `manifest` and that this also matches a position Mozilla took a while back, in 2014. That there should be a single manifest for apps.",
